WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.065
The Queries recipe step saves queries when a recipe runs.

00:00:07.065 --> 00:00:11.851
Each entry gives a Source and a Name, plus the properties of its source.

00:00:11.851 --> 00:00:14.550
A query with the same Name is updated.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:20.687
In a deployment plan, the All Queries step exports every query as a Queries step.

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:25.950
The Queried Content Items step exports the content items one query returns, and

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:29.480
refuses a query that does not return content items.

